---
description: Smatchet agent + project rules
globs: **/*
alwaysApply: true
---

See `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for project rules, the on-demand trigger →
rule-doc / skill table, delegation, semantic-codebase-search policy, and the
harness adapter mapping.

The three spawnable agents (`architect`, `code-review`, `security-review`) live
at `{{AGENT_LAYER}}agents/core/*.md`; a project's own agents, when it has any,
at `agents/project/*.md`.

Skills (`skills/<name>/SKILL.md`), the token-tracking hook contract and the
workflow scripts live under `{{AGENT_LAYER}}agents/_shared/`. Cursor does not
auto-discover skills: load the one whose row in the `AGENTS.md` on-demand table
matches the task.

Harness setup steps for any other harness (Claude Code, Codex, pi) live under
`{{AGENT_LAYER}}docs/harness/`.
